    794  f453							;   the pad is one tail-jump and 0 pushes.
    795  f453							; ($F4C4 / $F5CF pins DELETED 2026-10-20, audit round 2: TitleSequence was
    796  f453							;  retired with the merged title, so there is no jmp operand and no lst row to
    797  f453							;  match. ColOff is read as `lda ColOff,X`, so the table floats: it now starts
