    805  f453							; C5 (2026-10-20): B3RoomBlocks + ExtrasLoad — the room block loader.
    806  f453							; Living in the free $F453 window (it outgrew the $F8B7 half of its old
    807  f453							; window once the extras dispatch landed). Entered from ERBlocksPad
    808  f453							; (`jmp B3RoomBlocks`), tail-exits `jmp ERBlocksDone`; 0 pushes (the room-load
    809  f453							; chain sits at the measured SP floor).
    810  f453							;
    811  f453							; Shape block (C4/C5) = HOT STREAM | PF TRIPLE. The MetaA/MetaB pair is NOT
    812  f453							; in the block any more: `TilePF0+9/+10` is retired. A room with the shape
    813  f453							; byte's b7 set reads its pair (+patches+features) from the level's async
    814  f453							; extras stream; every other room derives MetaA = 0 and MetaB = $40 iff the
    815  f453							; shape carries hot records (row-1 'H' cells).
