   1927  fcad							; BuildColupF + HotOverlapBody moved to bank3 (A3 2026-10-19 — they walk the
   1928  fcad							; level-data record stream, which now lives there). The space below is fill;
   1929  fcad							; BombEnemyBlastBody stays PINNED at its original address so the bank0/bank2
   1930  fcad							; blast-tramp literals ($FDD8 twins) need no resync.
