   2055  fd2f							; --- No ball in this room → BE the ball gate off. ---------------------
   2056  fd2f							; BandTab is the per-band ENABL gate for the cave (.Row). MetaA bit0 is
   2057  fd2f							; the band-0 gate AND (for a door) the "M1 strip on the RIGHT half"
   2058  fd2f							; flag — a door has no ball, so its bit0 must NOT enable one. Before
   2059  fd2f							; this, the door room rendered a wall-coloured (COLUPF) ball bar over
   2060  fd2f							; the band-0 opening: ENABL on, RESPBL never strobed (Temp=0) → the
   2061  fd2f							; ball free-ran at x72-79 (user screenshot 2026-10-17, door_right.png).
